!games/naval-sail/unity-project/Assets/**/*.ogg

games/naval-sail/builds/

# Review-queue — local-only batch taste-decision cache.  Only the
# README.md + .gitkeep are tracked; the pending/ and decided/ subdirs
# carry per-machine artifact metadata that fails [[no-pii-in-repo]]
# (file paths, music titles, mood keywords, sometimes operator
# preferences).  See outputs/review-queue/README.md.
outputs/review-queue/pending/
outputs/review-queue/decided/

# Generated review-queue digest — re-rendered by
# scripts/review-queue-digest.sh on demand.  Contains the same
# per-machine artifact metadata as the pending/ entries it summarizes;
# stays local for the same reason.
docs/review-digest.md

# Playwright MCP runtime logs (per-session artifacts)
.playwright-mcp/

# Real-subject configs for the `idol` content-short (/idol-short).  A subject
# file names a real, trademarked group + members and points a tool at making
# content about them — kept LOCAL (IP / trademark / publicity-rights), same
# "abstract to genre in public" rule used elsewhere.  config/subjects/README.md
# (schema) and example.yaml (a fictional placeholder template) ARE tracked; real
# *.yaml subject files are not.
config/subjects/*.yaml
!config/subjects/example.yaml
*.safetensors

# Tiny Swords 추출물 — 팩 라이선스 재배포 금지 (scripts/extract-tinyswords.py 로 재생성)
# .png 만 미추적.  .png.meta 는 **커밋한다** — 아트 데이터가 아니라 임포트 설정 +
# GUID 텍스트이므로 재배포 조항과 무관하고, 미추적 시 GUID 가 체크아웃마다 새로
# 생성돼 씬·타일의 스프라이트 참조가 조용히 끊긴다 (2026-07-25 a06df81 사고:
# 병합이 ts_* 참조 11건을 유령 GUID 로 덮어써 지형·나무·폰·양이 전부 사라졌고
# 빌드 게이트는 통과했다 — 행동 게이트는 렌더 결손을 못 잡는다).
skills/game-prototype/unity-project/Assets/Sprites/ts_*.png
skills/game-prototype/unity-project/Assets/Resources/Sprites/ts_*.png

# graph/game_graph.py 가 사이클마다 쓰는 병합 스냅샷 — 산출물이므로 커밋하지 않는다
whiteboard-*.json

# 아트 생성 작업본 (시안·원본 512px) — 채택본만 Assets/Sprites 로 반입한다
skills/game-prototype/art-out/
